  "original_html": "<div class=\"entry-content\">\n<style id=\"uit-contact-page-fix\">\n#crumbs {\n  display: none !important;\n}\n\nmain#content {\n  padding-top: 0 !important;\n}\n</style>\n<header class=\"wp-block-group full-width bg-black py-4\"><div class=\"wp-block-group__inner-container is-layout-flow wp-block-group-is-layout-flow\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-group container text-white\"><div class=\"wp-block-group__inner-container is-layout-flow wp-block-group-is-layout-flow\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns are-vertically-aligned-center is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-9d6595d7 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\" style=\"flex-basis:33.33%\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-video is-provider-youtube wp-block-embed-youtube wp-embed-aspect-9-16 wp-has-aspect-ratio mb-0\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\n<iframe allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" allowfullscreen=\"\" frameborder=\"0\" height=\"1000\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/WWsW4GBSCLw?feature=oembed\" title=\"How To Get IT Help at York\" width=\"563\"></iframe>\n</div></figure>\n</div>\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center pl-md-5 is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\" style=\"flex-basis:66.67%\">\n<h1 class=\"wp-block-heading text-white mb-3\">Get IT help whenever &amp; wherever you need </h1>\n<p class=\"lead mb-0\">Our IT support services are decentralized, with each faculty having a dedicated IT support team. These local IT groups are your go-to for classroom and general support. Please contact your faculty IT support for the quickest and most effective assistance. If your faculty doesn't have its own IT support, or UIT handles your faculty's IT needs, contact us directly using the details below. We're here to help!</p>\n<p class=\"lead mb-0\"><strong><a href=\"#faculty-service-desks\">Find your local IT support team</a></strong></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div></div>\n</div></header>\n<div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\" style=\"height:61px\"></div>\n<div class=\"wp-block-group\"><div class=\"wp-block-group__inner-container is-layout-flow wp-block-group-is-layout-flow\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-9d6595d7 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\" style=\"flex-basis:100%\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-9d6595d7 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\" style=\"flex-basis:100%\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-9d6595d7 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\" style=\"flex-basis:100%\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-group\"><div class=\"wp-block-group__inner-container is-layout-flow wp-block-group-is-layout-flow\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-kadence-tabs alignnone\"><div class=\"kt-tabs-wrap kt-tabs-id29594_82334e-05 kt-tabs-has-5-tabs kt-active-tab-1 kt-tabs-layout-tabs kt-tabs-tablet-layout-inherit kt-tabs-mobile-layout-inherit kt-tab-alignment-center\"><ul class=\"kt-tabs-title-list\"><li class=\"kt-title-item kt-title-item-1 kt-tabs-svg-show-always kt-tabs-icon-side-right kt-tab-title-active\" id=\"in-person\"><a class=\"kt-tab-title kt-tab-title-1\" data-tab=\"1\" href=\"#in-person\"><span class=\"kt-title-text\">In Person</span></a></li><li class=\"kt-title-item kt-title-item-2 kt-tabs-svg-show-always kt-tabs-icon-side-right kt-tab-title-inactive\" id=\"online\"><a class=\"kt-tab-title kt-tab-title-2\" data-tab=\"2\" href=\"#online\"><span class=\"kt-title-text\">Online (Live Chat) </span></a></li><li class=\"kt-title-item kt-title-item-3 kt-tabs-svg-show-always kt-tabs-icon-side-right kt-tab-title-inactive\" id=\"phone\"><a class=\"kt-tab-title kt-tab-title-3\" data-tab=\"3\" href=\"#phone\"><span class=\"kt-title-text\">Phone  </span></a></li><li class=\"kt-title-item kt-title-item-4 kt-tabs-svg-show-always kt-tabs-icon-side-right kt-tab-title-inactive\" id=\"email\"><a class=\"kt-tab-title kt-tab-title-4\" data-tab=\"4\" href=\"#email\"><span class=\"kt-title-text\">Email</span></a></li><li class=\"kt-title-item kt-title-item-5 kt-tabs-svg-show-always kt-tabs-icon-side-right kt-tab-title-inactive\" id=\"faculty-service-desks\"><a class=\"kt-tab-title kt-tab-title-5\" data-tab=\"5\" href=\"#faculty-service-desks\"><span class=\"kt-title-text\">Faculty IT Service Desks </span></a></li></ul><div class=\"kt-tabs-content-wrap\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-kadence-tab kt-tab-inner-content kt-inner-tab-1 kt-inner-tabb6f21a-86\"><div class=\"kt-tab-inner-content-inner\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-group\"><div class=\"wp-block-group__inner-container is-layout-flow wp-block-group-is-layout-flow\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-group\"><div class=\"wp-block-group__inner-container is-layout-flow wp-block-group-is-layout-flow\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns are-vertically-aligned-center is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-9d6595d7 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\"></div>\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\" style=\"flex-basis:100%\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-9d6595d7 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\" style=\"flex-basis:100%\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-9d6595d7 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading mb-4\">How to Reach Us</h2>\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns contact-block is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-9d6595d7 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\" style=\"flex-basis:33.3%\">\n<iframe allowfullscreen=\"\" height=\"450\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer-when-downgrade\" src=\"https://www.google.com/maps?q=136+Campus+Walk,+North+York,+ON+M3J+1P3&amp;output=embed\" style=\"border:0;\" title=\"Map showing 136 Campus Walk, North York, Ontario\" width=\"100%\">\n</iframe>\n</div>\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\" style=\"flex-basis:70%\">\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading h6 text-uppercase text-primary border-bottom pb-2 mb-2\">Steacie Helpdesk</h3>\n<p><i class=\"fas fa-map-marker\"></i> <a data-id=\"https://map.concept3d.com/?id=1200#!m/317161?share\" data-type=\"link\" href=\"https://map.concept3d.com/?id=1200#!m/317161?share\"><strong>Steacie Science and Engineering Building (Main Floor, Room 107C), 136 Campus Walk</strong></a></p>\n<p><i class=\"fas fa-phone\"></i> <strong><a data-id=\"tel:4167365800\" data-type=\"tel\" href=\"tel:4167365800\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\">416-736-5800</a></strong></p>\n<p><i class=\"fas fa-clock\"></i> <strong>UIT Help Desk</strong><br/>Monday to Friday<br/>8:30 AM – 9:00 PM</p>\n<p><i class=\"fas fa-envelope\"></i> <a href=\"mailto:askIT@yorku.ca\"><strong>askIT@yorku.ca</strong></a></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><img alt=\"166 Campus walk \" class=\"wp-image-30306\" decoding=\"async\" fetchpriority=\"high\" height=\"1052\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1999px) 100vw, 1999px\" src=\"https://www.yorku.ca/uit/wp-content/uploads/sites/805/2023/12/USC-Service-Desk-Counter-v2-1-1.jpeg\" srcset=\"https://www.yorku.ca/uit/wp-content/uploads/sites/805/2023/12/USC-Service-Desk-Counter-v2-1-1.jpeg 1999w, https://www.yorku.ca/uit/wp-content/uploads/sites/805/2023/12/USC-Service-Desk-Counter-v2-1-1-300x158.jpeg 300w, https://www.yorku.ca/uit/wp-content/uploads/sites/805/2023/12/USC-Service-Desk-Counter-v2-1-1-1536x808.jpeg 1536w\" width=\"1999\"/></figure>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div></div>\n</div></div>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"wp-block-kadence-tab kt-tab-inner-content kt-inner-tab-2 kt-inner-tabe039fb-04\"><div class=\"kt-tab-inner-content-inner\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full is-resized\"><img alt=\"laptop icon\" class=\"wp-image-33842\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"342\" sizes=\"(max-width: 407px) 100vw, 407px\" src=\"https://www.yorku.ca/uit/wp-content/uploads/sites/805/2024/05/Screenshot-15-edited.png\" srcset=\"https://www.yorku.ca/uit/wp-content/uploads/sites/805/2024/05/Screenshot-15-edited.png 407w, https://www.yorku.ca/uit/wp-content/uploads/sites/805/2024/05/Screenshot-15-edited-300x252.png 300w\" style=\"width:111px;height:93px\" width=\"407\"/></figure>\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-black-color has-text-color\">Live Chat </h2>\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-9d6595d7 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color\"><strong>(Live Chat Button can be found on your right-hand side) </strong></p>\n<p>Use this chat for general inquiries such as identity management (Passport York), Duo 2FA, email, wireless services (AirYorkPlus, VPN), Office 365, printing, in-class technology and security.</p>\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Available Hours<br/></h2>\n<figure class=\"wp-block-table\"><table class=\"has-fixed-layout\"><thead><tr><th><strong>Day</strong></th><th><strong>Hours</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Monday</td><td>8:30 AM – 4:30 PM</td></tr><tr><td>Tuesday</td><td>8:30 AM – 4:30 PM</td></tr><tr><td>Wednesday</td><td>8:30 AM – 4:30 PM</td></tr><tr><td>Thursday</td><td>8:30 AM – 4:30 PM</td></tr><tr><td>Friday</td><td>8:30 AM – 4:30 PM</td></tr><tr><td>Saturday</td><td>Closed</td></tr><tr><td>Sunday</td><td>Closed</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<p></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"wp-block-kadence-tab kt-tab-inner-content kt-inner-tab-3 kt-inner-tabc922aa-ab\"><div class=\"kt-tab-inner-content-inner\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full is-resized\"><img alt=\"phone icon\" class=\"wp-image-33847\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"506\" loading=\"lazy\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 285px) 100vw, 285px\" src=\"https://www.yorku.ca/uit/wp-content/uploads/sites/805/2024/05/Screenshot-14-1.png\" srcset=\"https://www.yorku.ca/uit/wp-content/uploads/sites/805/2024/05/Screenshot-14-1.png 285w, https://www.yorku.ca/uit/wp-content/uploads/sites/805/2024/05/Screenshot-14-1-169x300.png 169w\" style=\"width:78px;height:139px\" width=\"285\"/></figure>\n<p><strong><span class=\"has-inline-color has-black-color\">Phone Number:</span> <a data-id=\"tel:4167365800\" data-type=\"tel\" href=\"tel:4167365800\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\">416-736-5800</a></strong></p>\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Available <span class=\"has-inline-color has-black-color\">Hours</span></h2>\n<figure class=\"wp-block-table\"><table class=\"has-fixed-layout\"><thead><tr><th><strong>Service</strong></th><th><strong>Hours</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Students and Alumni Support</td><td>Monday to Friday, 8:30 AM – 6:00 PM</td></tr><tr><td>Classroom Support</td><td>Monday to Friday, 8:30 AM – 9:00 PM</td></tr><tr><td>Faculty and Staff Support</td><td>Monday to Friday, 8:30 AM – 9:00 PM</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"wp-block-kadence-tab kt-tab-inner-content kt-inner-tab-4 kt-inner-tabf0353a-39\"><div class=\"kt-tab-inner-content-inner\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full is-resized\"><img alt=\"email @ (at) symbol \" class=\"wp-image-33844\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"296\" loading=\"lazy\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 302px) 100vw, 302px\" src=\"https://www.yorku.ca/uit/wp-content/uploads/sites/805/2024/05/image-15-edited-1.png\" srcset=\"https://www.yorku.ca/uit/wp-content/uploads/sites/805/2024/05/image-15-edited-1.png 302w, https://www.yorku.ca/uit/wp-content/uploads/sites/805/2024/05/image-15-edited-1-300x294.png 300w\" style=\"width:117px;height:114px\" width=\"302\"/></figure>\n<p><strong><span class=\"has-inline-color has-black-color\">Email Address:</span> <a href=\"mailto:askit@yorku.ca\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\">askIT@yorku.ca</a></strong></p>\n<p>You can email us anytime. We have staff dedicated to answering your emails during our available hours.</p>\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><span class=\"has-inline-color has-black-color\">Available Hours<br/></span></h2>\n<figure class=\"wp-block-table\"><table class=\"has-fixed-layout\"><thead><tr><th><strong>Day</strong></th><th><strong>Hours</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Monday</td><td>8:30 AM – 9:00 PM</td></tr><tr><td>Tuesday</td><td>8:30 AM – 9:00 PM</td></tr><tr><td>Wednesday</td><td>8:30 AM – 9:00 PM</td></tr><tr><td>Thursday</td><td>8:30 AM – 9:00 PM</td></tr><tr><td>Friday</td><td>8:30 AM – 9:00 PM</td></tr><tr><td>Saturday</td><td>Closed</td></tr><tr><td>Sunday</td><td>Closed</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><em><strong>During Exam Periods (F, W, S1, S2)</strong></em></h2>\n<p><em>In addition to the hours posted above, technicians are also scheduled to respond to emails on Saturday and Sunday, 8:00 AM to 4:00 PM,</em> during exam periods.</p>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"wp-block-kadence-tab kt-tab-inner-content kt-inner-tab-5 kt-inner-tab4fcaff-5d\"><div class=\"kt-tab-inner-content-inner\">\n<p>Faculty IT Service Desks provide primary support to their community.</p>\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><a href=\"https://eso.laps.yorku.ca/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Faculty of Liberal Arts and Professional Studies (LA&amp;PS) - eServices Office</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.yorku.ca/edu/students/it-services/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Faculty of Education – Information Technology Services</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://euc.yorku.ca/euc-technology-services/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Faculty of Environmental Studies Computing Services</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.yorku.ca/uit/contact/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Faculty of Graduate Studies</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.yorku.ca/uit/contact/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Faculty of Health</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.yorku.ca/science/profiles/contact/it-services/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Faculty of Science</a></li>\n<li><a data-id=\"https://computing.ampd.yorku.ca/\" data-type=\"URL\" href=\"https://computing.ampd.yorku.ca/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\">AMPD Computing</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.glendon.yorku.ca/its/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Glendon - Information Technology Services</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"http://lassonde.yorku.ca/get-touch\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Lassonde School of Engineering</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"http://www.osgoode.yorku.ca/its\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Osgoode Hall Law School</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://schulich.yorku.ca/ist/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Schulich School of Business - Information Services &amp; Technology</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"http://www.library.yorku.ca/web/ask-services/computing/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Library and Computing Services - Facilities &amp; Equipment</a></li>\n</ul>\n</div></div>\n</div></div></div>\n</div></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p></p>\n</div></div>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"entry-links\"></div>\n</div>",
  "html": "\n<figure>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/WWsW4GBSCLw?feature=oembed\">How To Get IT Help at York</a></p>\n</figure>\n<h2>Get IT help whenever &amp; wherever you need </h2>\n<p>Our IT support services are decentralized, with each faculty having a dedicated IT support team. These local IT groups are your go-to for classroom and general support. Please contact your faculty IT support for the quickest and most effective assistance. If your faculty doesn't have its own IT support, or UIT handles your faculty's IT needs, contact us directly using the details below. We're here to help!</p>\n<p><strong><a href=\"https://www.yorku.ca/uit/contact/#faculty-service-desks\">Find your local IT support team</a></strong></p>\n<h2>In Person</h2>\n<h2>How to Reach Us</h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps?q=136+Campus+Walk,+North+York,+ON+M3J+1P3&amp;output=embed\">Map showing 136 Campus Walk, North York, Ontario</a></p>\n<h3>Steacie Helpdesk</h3>\n<p><i></i> <a href=\"https://map.concept3d.com/?id=1200#!m/317161?share\"><strong>Steacie Science and Engineering Building (Main Floor, Room 107C), 136 Campus Walk</strong></a></p>\n<p><i></i> <strong><a href=\"tel:4167365800\">416-736-5800</a></strong></p>\n<p><i></i> <strong>UIT Help Desk</strong><br/>Monday to Friday<br/>8:30 AM – 9:00 PM</p>\n<p><i></i> <a href=\"mailto:askIT@yorku.ca\"><strong>askIT@yorku.ca</strong></a></p>\n<figure><img alt=\"166 Campus walk \" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.yorku.ca/uit/wp-content/uploads/sites/805/2023/12/USC-Service-Desk-Counter-v2-1-1.jpeg\"/></figure>\n<h2>Online (Live Chat)</h2>\n<figure><img alt=\"laptop icon\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.yorku.ca/uit/wp-content/uploads/sites/805/2024/05/Screenshot-15-edited.png\"/></figure>\n<h2>Live Chat </h2>\n<p><strong>(Live Chat Button can be found on your right-hand side) </strong></p>\n<p>Use this chat for general inquiries such as identity management (Passport York), Duo 2FA, email, wireless services (AirYorkPlus, VPN), Office 365, printing, in-class technology and security.</p>\n<h2>Available Hours<br/></h2>\n<figure><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Day</strong></th><th><strong>Hours</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Monday</td><td>8:30 AM – 4:30 PM</td></tr><tr><td>Tuesday</td><td>8:30 AM – 4:30 PM</td></tr><tr><td>Wednesday</td><td>8:30 AM – 4:30 PM</td></tr><tr><td>Thursday</td><td>8:30 AM – 4:30 PM</td></tr><tr><td>Friday</td><td>8:30 AM – 4:30 PM</td></tr><tr><td>Saturday</td><td>Closed</td></tr><tr><td>Sunday</td><td>Closed</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<p></p>\n<h2>Phone</h2>\n<figure><img alt=\"phone icon\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.yorku.ca/uit/wp-content/uploads/sites/805/2024/05/Screenshot-14-1.png\"/></figure>\n<p><strong>Phone Number: <a href=\"tel:4167365800\">416-736-5800</a></strong></p>\n<h2>Available Hours</h2>\n<figure><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Service</strong></th><th><strong>Hours</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Students and Alumni Support</td><td>Monday to Friday, 8:30 AM – 6:00 PM</td></tr><tr><td>Classroom Support</td><td>Monday to Friday, 8:30 AM – 9:00 PM</td></tr><tr><td>Faculty and Staff Support</td><td>Monday to Friday, 8:30 AM – 9:00 PM</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<h2>Email</h2>\n<figure><img alt=\"email @ (at) symbol \" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.yorku.ca/uit/wp-content/uploads/sites/805/2024/05/image-15-edited-1.png\"/></figure>\n<p><strong>Email Address: <a href=\"mailto:askit@yorku.ca\">askIT@yorku.ca</a></strong></p>\n<p>You can email us anytime. We have staff dedicated to answering your emails during our available hours.</p>\n<h2>Available Hours<br/></h2>\n<figure><table><thead><tr><th><strong>Day</strong></th><th><strong>Hours</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Monday</td><td>8:30 AM – 9:00 PM</td></tr><tr><td>Tuesday</td><td>8:30 AM – 9:00 PM</td></tr><tr><td>Wednesday</td><td>8:30 AM – 9:00 PM</td></tr><tr><td>Thursday</td><td>8:30 AM – 9:00 PM</td></tr><tr><td>Friday</td><td>8:30 AM – 9:00 PM</td></tr><tr><td>Saturday</td><td>Closed</td></tr><tr><td>Sunday</td><td>Closed</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<h2><em><strong>During Exam Periods (F, W, S1, S2)</strong></em></h2>\n<p><em>In addition to the hours posted above, technicians are also scheduled to respond to emails on Saturday and Sunday, 8:00 AM to 4:00 PM,</em> during exam periods.</p>\n<h2>Faculty IT Service Desks</h2>\n<p>Faculty IT Service Desks provide primary support to their community.</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://eso.laps.yorku.ca/\">Faculty of Liberal Arts and Professional Studies (LA&amp;PS) - eServices Office</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.yorku.ca/edu/students/it-services/\">Faculty of Education – Information Technology Services</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://euc.yorku.ca/euc-technology-services/\">Faculty of Environmental Studies Computing Services</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.yorku.ca/uit/contact/\">Faculty of Graduate Studies</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.yorku.ca/uit/contact/\">Faculty of Health</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.yorku.ca/science/profiles/contact/it-services/\">Faculty of Science</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://computing.ampd.yorku.ca/\">AMPD Computing</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.glendon.yorku.ca/its/\">Glendon - Information Technology Services</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"http://lassonde.yorku.ca/get-touch\">Lassonde School of Engineering</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"http://www.osgoode.yorku.ca/its\">Osgoode Hall Law School</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://schulich.yorku.ca/ist/\">Schulich School of Business - Information Services &amp; Technology</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"http://www.library.yorku.ca/web/ask-services/computing/\">Library and Computing Services - Facilities &amp; Equipment</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n",
  "text": "Get IT help whenever & wherever you need Our IT support services are decentralized, with each faculty having a dedicated IT support team. These local IT groups are your go-to for classroom and general support. Please contact your faculty IT support for the quickest and most effective assistance. If your faculty doesn't have its own IT support, or UIT handles your faculty's IT needs, contact us directly using the details below. We're here to help! Find your local IT support team In Person Online (Live Chat) Phone Email Faculty IT Service Desks How to Reach Us Steacie Helpdesk Steacie Science and Engineering Building (Main Floor, Room 107C), 136 Campus Walk 416-736-5800 UIT Help Desk Monday to Friday 8:30 AM – 9:00 PM askIT@yorku.ca Live Chat (Live Chat Button can be found on your right-hand side) Use this chat for general inquiries such as identity management (Passport York), Duo 2FA, email, wireless services (AirYorkPlus, VPN), Office 365, printing, in-class technology and security. Available Hours Day Hours Monday 8:30 AM – 4:30 PM Tuesday 8:30 AM – 4:30 PM Wednesday 8:30 AM – 4:30 PM Thursday 8:30 AM – 4:30 PM Friday 8:30 AM – 4:30 PM Saturday Closed Sunday Closed Phone Number: 416-736-5800 Available Hours Service Hours Students and Alumni Support Monday to Friday, 8:30 AM – 6:00 PM Classroom Support Monday to Friday, 8:30 AM – 9:00 PM Faculty and Staff Support Monday to Friday, 8:30 AM – 9:00 PM Email Address: askIT@yorku.ca You can email us anytime. We have staff dedicated to answering your emails during our available hours. Available Hours Day Hours Monday 8:30 AM – 9:00 PM Tuesday 8:30 AM – 9:00 PM Wednesday 8:30 AM – 9:00 PM Thursday 8:30 AM – 9:00 PM Friday 8:30 AM – 9:00 PM Saturday Closed Sunday Closed During Exam Periods (F, W, S1, S2) In addition to the hours posted above, technicians are also scheduled to respond to emails on Saturday and Sunday, 8:00 AM to 4:00 PM, during exam periods. Faculty IT Service Desks provide primary support to their community. Faculty of Liberal Arts and Professional Studies (LA&PS) - eServices Office Faculty of Education – Information Technology Services Faculty of Environmental Studies Computing Services Faculty of Graduate Studies Faculty of Health Faculty of Science AMPD Computing Glendon - Information Technology Services Lassonde School of Engineering Osgoode Hall Law School Schulich School of Business - Information Services & Technology Library and Computing Services - Facilities & Equipment",
